stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created: executeCommand
    Created --> Scheduled: retain Process under Nmcli
    Scheduled --> Running: Qt.callLater / exec
    Running --> CallbackDelivered: password error or exit result
    Running --> Finished: exit without callback
    CallbackDelivered --> Finished: process exits
    Finished --> Released: remove from activeProcesses and destroy
    Released --> [*]
